The [[Corrupted Zunraa]] is the last enemy in [[An Unwelcome Guest]], and is the evil opposite of [[Zunraa]], the spirit that watches over [[Zen Daijun]].

== Location ==
* [[Shing Jea Island]]
** {{NPC location|Zen Daijun|explorable area}} (only during [[An Unwelcome Guest]])

== Skills ==
14 [[Smiting Prayers]]
* {{skill icon|Balthazar's Aura}}
* {{skill icon|Kirin's Wrath}}
* {{skill icon|Reversal of Fortune}}
* {{skill icon|Signet of Rage}}
* {{monster skill icon|Blessing of the Kirin}}

== Notes ==
[[File:Corrupted Zunraa with Weapons.jpg|150px|thumb|right|A wand and a focus can be seen through the Corrupted Zunraa's hoofs.]]
* It appears once you clear the last of the miasma from the [[Daijun Library]]. 
* Fighting it can be made much easier with [[enchantment removal]].
{{bug|Occasionally, it will not spawn.}}
{{bug|It irregularly spawns with weapons clipping through its hoof.}}
